BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Collisions with the ground scatter</h1>
Delta-gliders driven into a boulder on the Moon and into a tree in a
forest on the Earth: both must be stopped by them.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/ScatterCollisionTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship MOON
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET MOON
  MODE Extern
  POS 4.0 -20.0 -30
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
MOON:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Moon
  POS 23.5000 0.7000
  HEADING 0.00
  GEAR 1 1.0000
  PRPLEVEL 0:0.300 1:1.000
END
EARTH:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Earth
  POS 25.0000 62.0000
  HEADING 0.00
  GEAR 1 1.0000
  PRPLEVEL 0:0.300 1:1.000
END
END_SHIPS
